{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-demo-001","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-001"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-001/answers/answer-demo-001","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T00:00:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-03-01T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-06-01T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"本科毕业后应该先工作还是读研？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我家里暂时不能支持我继续读书，毕业时拿到了一份稳定的工作。我先工作两年，建立储蓄并确认自己想研究的方向，之后利用周末准备考试，最终读了在职研究生。对我来说，先工作降低了经济压力，但也牺牲了部分空闲时间。","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-education","name":"教育选择"},{"external_id":"topic-career","name":"职业规划"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T00:00:00Z","voteup_count":42,"comment_count":8,"thanks_count":3},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-001"},"raw":{"sha256":"4c4a7d406ee34c23a8741ab19c24b7cef1b03f60d82f108879643f44f1bfba8e","payload":{"external_id":"answer-demo-001"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-demo-002","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-001"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-001/answers/answer-demo-002","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T00:01:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-04-12T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-07-18T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"本科毕业后应该先工作还是读研？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我毕业时已经确定想做科研，也拿到了奖学金和导师的明确课题，因此选择直接读研。第一年收入会少一些，但学校资源和同伴环境让我更快确认了研究方向。这个选择依赖奖学金、家庭支持和明确的专业目标，不适合直接套给所有人。","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-education","name":"教育选择"},{"external_id":"topic-research","name":"科研道路"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T00:01:00Z","voteup_count":67,"comment_count":11,"thanks_count":5},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-002"},"raw":{"sha256":"0ee3da09cf1c78454650e1629de36820cdd73d2ece45c0d8c6a0ec409ba5b227","payload":{"external_id":"answer-demo-002"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-demo-003","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-002"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-002/answers/answer-demo-003","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T00:02:00Z","source_created_at":"2023-08-20T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-02-20T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"要不要从大厂转去创业团队？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我在大公司工作了五年，手里有十八个月的储蓄，也想承担更大的业务责任，所以接受了创业团队的邀请。前六个月节奏很快，后来公司融资失败，我又凭借这段经历找到了新的工作。这个决定的前提是现金储备和可接受的失败成本。","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career","name":"职业选择"},{"external_id":"topic-startup","name":"创业"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T00:02:00Z","voteup_count":31,"comment_count":6,"thanks_count":2},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-003"},"raw":{"sha256":"f2b8217504d943b27c06d649d28d2be6f2fc2aa4de950d48d5b7694fdf60ef17","payload":{"external_id":"answer-demo-003"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-demo-004","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-002"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-002/answers/answer-demo-004","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T00:03:00Z","source_created_at":"2023-09-03T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"要不要从大厂转去创业团队？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我也认真考虑过创业，但当时家里有房贷，储蓄只能覆盖四个月生活费，伴侣也不希望承担突然失业的风险。于是我留在大公司，同时用下班时间做小项目。虽然没有立刻转型，但两年后我积累了作品和资金，再选择下一步时更从容。","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career","name":"职业选择"},{"external_id":"topic-risk","name":"风险管理"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T00:03:00Z","voteup_count":54,"comment_count":9,"thanks_count":4},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-004"},"raw":{"sha256":"7f5ba61e55c5ec2da63ed5115c448c95212fd54e02566008f6714e044742ab85","payload":{"external_id":"answer-demo-004"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-demo-005","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-003"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-003/answers/answer-demo-005","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T00:04:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-01-08T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-05-08T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"转行数据分析是否应该报班？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我没有报班，先用公开课程补统计基础，再做了三个能展示业务理解的项目，每周找从业者改简历。六个月后我拿到第一份数据分析工作。自学对我有效，是因为我能自己安排时间，也能找到人反馈；如果缺少结构和反馈，路径可能会更慢。","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career-change","name":"转行"},{"external_id":"topic-learning","name":"学习方式"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T00:04:00Z","voteup_count":38,"comment_count":7,"thanks_count":3},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-005"},"raw":{"sha256":"c122482cfbee3cb3a8540916e3f04bce2101c50d66705ac0906ef0a341bbf8a4","payload":{"external_id":"answer-demo-005"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-demo-006","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-003"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-003/answers/answer-demo-006","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T00:05:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-02-14T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-08-14T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"转行数据分析是否应该报班？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我选择了付费训练营，因为白天上班，自己学习时经常拖延，也不知道作品集做到什么程度才算合格。训练营给了固定节奏和同学反馈，但费用不低，课程质量也需要提前核实。对我而言，购买的是监督和反馈，不是课程本身的神奇效果。","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career-change","name":"转行"},{"external_id":"topic-learning","name":"学习方式"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T00:05:00Z","voteup_count":46,"comment_count":10,"thanks_count":4},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-006"},"raw":{"sha256":"686dd3483b093d0e3fac04d52c44c9658e40cd8e879d111df0fed65599c75cf3","payload":{"external_id":"answer-demo-006"}}}
